# Fights at Reorte, a dictatorship 4.4 light years from Lave, and meets the Shuttle, Fer-de-Lance, Barrel, Boa,
# Gecko and Cobra Mk I. It starts from combat-reorte.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the fighter (a military
# laser, ECM, an energy unit, 20 kills) with its random state 18,240,617 draws on. It finds Reorte on the
# short-range chart and jumps there. In space it holds J and full speed whenever no ship but a rock or a barrel is
# about: while the jump drive is engaged, ships of every class spawn 32 times as often (ScaleSpawnOdds) until a
# ship mass-locks the drive. The draw count was found by the search combat-orerve.replay describes, for the three
# combat replays together. The fight was played by a scratch program that steered at the nearest ship by its
# position each frame and fired when it was in the sights; what it pressed is recorded here like any other replay.
file JAMESON.CDR combat-reorte.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # D10, Disc access, on Load commander
key 1; wait 0.3                    # Load commander: the catalogue, JAMESON.CDR selected
key Return; wait 0.5               # loaded
