key F5; wait 0.5                   # the short-range chart: F finds a system by name
key f; wait 0.3; key r; key e; key o; key r; key t; key e; key Return; wait 0.399
key F1; wait 0.401                   # launch
down h; wait 1; up h               # the countdown to Reorte
wait 8
